      "text": "Virtual Address Space (OS view)\n\nstruct zone {\n    unsigned long start;\n    unsigned long size;\n    unsigned int permissions;\n    struct zone *next, *prev;\n};\n\nstruct zone *pvas_head; // sentinel, head",
